This directory contains the files needed to perform a cycle run. 

The following files will need to be edited for your project:

set_environment.sh - Configuration file for cycle;
                        set working directories, run length, cycle length and slurm options

setup_initial.sh - Setup to be run before the first cycle; 
                    creates folders, links restarts, domain files and executables

setup_year.sh - Setup needed during the run for each year of the cycle;
                    Links lateral and surface boundary files, as well as rivers


The following files should not need to be edited:

cycle_outer.slurm - This is the script to execute to run the cycle

cycle_inner.slurm - Handles multiple cycles on a single job submission

update_nemo_nl - perl script to update namelists each cycle
